<title>USA: Fed says weekend system RPs total $2.065 billion.</title>
<headline>Fed says weekend system RPs total $2.065 billion.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it added temporary  reserves to the banking system Friday morning via a round of weekend  system repurchase agreements.</p>
<p>The weekend system operation totaled $2.065 billion, the Federal Reserve  Bank of New York confirmed.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
